{"judgments": [
  {"clause_id": "c001",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "\"Place tremendous value in our investment banking relationships\" and \"significant step\" are promotional expressions with no ascertainable content, so a court could be asked whether they are mere puffery or a commitment. The provision supplies no standard against which \"broad based, high quality investment banking services\" could be measured.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.30},
     {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.07}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c002",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "\"Well suited to this situation\" is an unmeasurable evaluative phrase stated as a feeling (\"We feel\"), leaving it uncertain whether anything is being represented at all. A court would have to decide whether this is opinion or an actionable statement of capability.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.28},
     {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.06}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c003",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "\"Unparalleled auction rate performance\" (along with \"unique idea generation\" and \"a sincere desire\") is a superlative with no defined benchmark, and the open-ended \"These strengths include:\" leaves the list's outer reach undetermined. In an auction-rate context a court would have to decide what performance, if any, was promised by that word.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.58},
     {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.10}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c004",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "\"The commitment and depth of services that we are prepared to provide\" is hedged by \"We hope that this proposal helps to demonstrate,\" so it is unclear whether any service level is being undertaken. The words \"commitment\" and \"depth\" have no defined content.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.26},
     {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.06}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c005",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "This is a garbled RFP question whose bulleted service list has been interleaved with the question text, so which services are within \"the following key services\" cannot be read off the page. The enumeration is also introduced as \"key services,\" leaving unclear whether the list is exhaustive of what was requested.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.27},
     {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.10}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c006",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "\"A full range of investing, advisory, and financing services\" is a descriptive corporate self-description whose boundary (\"full range\") is undefined. It is descriptive rather than promissory, so the risk of construction is modest.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.17},
     {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.05}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c007",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": null, "type": 1, "prob": 0.12},
     {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.05}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c008",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "\"Complete, broad based, intensive coverage ... regardless of where they are in their capital cycle\" uses three unquantified adjectives, and \"intensive coverage\" has no ascertainable content. A court asked whether a service standard was undertaken would have to construe these words.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.30},
     {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.07}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c009",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "\"Focusing on what is best for the client rather than what produces the next trade\" is precisely the kind of phrase a client invokes to assert a duty of loyalty, and its scope (advice only? principal transactions?) is undefined. \"Product innovator and market leader\" is likewise unmeasurable.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.44},
     {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.10}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c010",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "\"Govern our approach to all of our business activities\" leaves it uncertain whether the Business Principles appended as Appendix A are binding obligations or aspirational statements. \"Govern\" is the word a court would have to construe.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.36},
     {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.14}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c011",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "\"Our clients' interests always come first\" is the classic quoted principle a client relies on to assert a fiduciary or loyalty obligation, and the sentence gives no limits on when or how it applies. Its status as an incorporated quotation from Appendix A rather than an undertaking is itself the thing to be construed.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.54},
     {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.12}
   ]},
  {"clause_id": "c012",
   "issues": [
     {"issue": "\"Charged with accessing and directing the Firm's vast resources\" states an internal duty without saying to whom it is owed or what performance it requires. \"Vast resources\" has no measurable boundary.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.30},
     {"issue": null, "type": 2, "prob": 0.08}
   ]}
]}

